{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24000","headline":"水堂醉卧问杜三十一 · 白居易","name":"水堂醉卧问杜三十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君洛下住多年，何处春流最可怜？\n爲问魏王堤岸下，何如同德寺门前。\n无妨水色堪闲翫，不得泉声伴醉眠。\n那似此堂帘幕底，连明连夜碧潺湲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}